<title>BELGIUM: EU publishes new starch export refund rates.</title>
<headline>EU publishes new starch export refund rates.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union has published new non-Annex II export refund rates for starch in the Official Journal.</p>
<p>The rates are given, in ecus per 100 kg of basic product, as:</p>
<p>    maize starch		    1.210</p>
<p>    potato starch		   0.805</p>
<p>    broken rice as starch	 0.940</p>
<p>    glucose and glucose syrup   0.805</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
